[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p>1. Take out the ashtray.</p><p>2. Extract the cigar lighter housing (2a) using the special tool.\nThe tool should engage in the recesses (2b) of the cigar lighter\nhousing.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Pliers</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.028.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019544.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the cigarette lighter\nseating is undamaged.</p><p>1. Fit the cigar lighter housing (1a).</p><p>Position the cigar lighter so that the contact plate (1b) is aligned\nwith the bulb contact (1c).</p><p>2. Fit the cigarette lighter.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019545.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p>1. Take out the ashtray.</p><p>2. Withdraw the cigarette lighter seating (2a) using the special\ntool (2b). The tool must engage in the recesses (2c) in the cigarette\nlighter seating.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Pliers</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.823.028.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Cigar lighter / current socket</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237282\">P50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019546.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the cigarette lighter seating\nis undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>1. Fit the cigar lighter housing (1a) using the special tool (1b)\nso that the contact plate (1c) is aligned with the bulb contact\n(1d).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019547.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<p>Fit the cigar lighter in the housing.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p>"]]